{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20189","headline":"夏日谒智远禅师 · 孟郊","name":"夏日谒智远禅师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾师当几祖，说法云无空。\n禅心三界外，宴坐天地中。\n院静鬼神去，身与草木同。\n因知护王国，满鉢盛毒龙。\n抖擞尘埃衣，谒师见真宗。\n何必千万劫，瞬息去樊笼。\n盛夏火爲日，一堂十月风。\n不得爲弟子，名姓挂儒宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20189.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20189","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}